%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 835cf09e870248d45aa148774404020c, type: 3}
  m_Name: TutorialScript
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Spaa.Runtime::Spaa.Tutorial.TutorialScriptSO
  steps:
  - id: welcome
    kind: 0
    scene: 0
    targetName: 
    holeTargetName: 
    dock: 0
    lines:
    - Well met, hero! I am Wombino the Wise.
    - In Better Quest you win battles by finishing real-life habits. Let me show you around.
    footnote: 
    transitions: []
    resumeStepId: 
    lockSkipUntilFirstHabit: 0
    notYetLabel: 
    expression: 0
    faceElement: 0
    showLearnMore: 0
    showElements: 0
  - id: therapy-1
    kind: 0
    scene: 0
    targetName: 
    holeTargetName: 
    dock: 0
    lines:
    - THINK+SMART is a self-guided metabolic wellness program designed to improve mental health and brain function through nutrition and daily habits.
    - Tap Learn more to read about the program.
    footnote: 
    transitions: []
    resumeStepId: 
    lockSkipUntilFirstHabit: 0
    notYetLabel: 
    expression: 0
    faceElement: 0
    showLearnMore: 1
    showElements: 0
  - id: therapy-2
    kind: 0
    scene: 0
    targetName: 
    holeTargetName: 
    dock: 0
    lines:
    - Better Quest turns those daily habits into a battle.
    - Plan your habits, do them in real life, then log them here to attack!
    footnote: Not medical advice. Follow your care team's guidance.
    transitions: []
    resumeStepId: 
    lockSkipUntilFirstHabit: 0
    notYetLabel: 
    expression: 0
    faceElement: 0
    showLearnMore: 0
    showElements: 0
  - id: elements
    kind: 0
    scene: 0
    targetName: 
    holeTargetName: 
    dock: 0
    lines:
    - 'Every habit belongs to one of five pillars:'
    - 'Rest: sleep and quiet time. Self Care: looking after your body.'
    - 'Food: what and when you eat. Rebuild: friends, feelings and reflection. Move: getting active.'
    footnote: 
    transitions: []
    resumeStepId: 
    lockSkipUntilFirstHabit: 0
    notYetLabel: 
    expression: 0
    faceElement: 0
    showLearnMore: 0
    showElements: 1
  - id: foe
    kind: 0
    scene: 0
    targetName: today-plaque
    holeTargetName: 
    dock: 0
    lines:
    - Each day a new monster appears.
    - 'It''s weak to one pillar: habits from that pillar hit twice as hard.'
    footnote: 
    transitions: []
    resumeStepId: 
    lockSkipUntilFirstHabit: 0
    notYetLabel: 
    expression: 0
    faceElement: 0
    showLearnMore: 0
    showElements: 0
  - id: open-journal
    kind: 1
    scene: 0
    targetName: habit-menu-button
    holeTargetName: 
    dock: 0
    lines:
    - Let's write your habits. Tap Habits.
    footnote: 
    transitions:
    - on: 4
      state: 2
      toStepId: journal
      replayOnly: 0
    resumeStepId: 
    lockSkipUntilFirstHabit: 1
    notYetLabel: 
    expression: 0
    faceElement: 0
    showLearnMore: 0
    showElements: 0
  - id: journal
    kind: 0
    scene: 0
    targetName: habit-list-scroll
    holeTargetName: 
    dock: 0
    lines:
    - These starter habits fill every pillar.
    - Tap any card later to rename it or change how often you do it.
    footnote: 
    transitions: []
    resumeStepId: open-journal
    lockSkipUntilFirstHabit: 1
    notYetLabel: 
    expression: 0
    faceElement: 0
    showLearnMore: 0
    showElements: 0
  - id: add-habit
    kind: 1
    scene: 0
    targetName: habit-add-button
    holeTargetName: 
    dock: 0
    lines:
    - Now add one habit from your own plan. Tap New Habit.
    - Every hero starts with one!
    footnote: 
    transitions:
    - on: 5
      state: 0
      toStepId: write-name
      replayOnly: 0
    - on: 2
      state: 0
      toStepId: back-to-menu
      replayOnly: 1
    resumeStepId: open-journal
    lockSkipUntilFirstHabit: 1
    notYetLabel: Skip for now
    expression: 0
    faceElement: 0
    showLearnMore: 0
    showElements: 0
  - id: write-name
    kind: 1
    scene: 0
    targetName: habit-name-field
    holeTargetName: habit-edit-card
    dock: 1
    lines:
    - Write it the way you'd say it, like "Walk after lunch".
    - Pick its pillar and how many times a day, then tap Save Habit.
    footnote: 
    transitions:
    - on: 7
      state: 0
      toStepId: habit-saved
      replayOnly: 0
    - on: 6
      state: 0
      toStepId: add-habit
      replayOnly: 0
    - on: 2
      state: 0
      toStepId: back-to-menu
      replayOnly: 1
    resumeStepId: open-journal
    lockSkipUntilFirstHabit: 1
    notYetLabel: Skip for now
    expression: 0
    faceElement: 0
    showLearnMore: 0
    showElements: 0
  - id: habit-saved
    kind: 0
    scene: 0
    targetName: habit-list-scroll
    holeTargetName: 
    dock: 0
    lines:
    - Wonderful! That habit is now one of your attacks.
    - Every pillar needs at least one habit to battle. You can add more any time.
    footnote: 
    transitions: []
    resumeStepId: play
    lockSkipUntilFirstHabit: 0
    notYetLabel: 
    expression: 0
    faceElement: 4
    showLearnMore: 0
    showElements: 0
  - id: back-to-menu
    kind: 1
    scene: 0
    targetName: habit-menu-back-button
    holeTargetName: 
    dock: 0
    lines:
    - Now let's meet today's monster. Tap Back.
    footnote: 
    transitions:
    - on: 4
      state: 1
      toStepId: play
      replayOnly: 0
    resumeStepId: play
    lockSkipUntilFirstHabit: 0
    notYetLabel: 
    expression: 0
    faceElement: 0
    showLearnMore: 0
    showElements: 0
  - id: play
    kind: 1
    scene: 0
    targetName: play-button
    holeTargetName: 
    dock: 0
    lines:
    - Tap Battle! when you're ready.
    footnote: 
    transitions:
    - on: 4
      state: 3
      toStepId: battle-intro
      replayOnly: 0
    - on: 10
      state: 0
      toStepId: rest-day
      replayOnly: 0
    resumeStepId: 
    lockSkipUntilFirstHabit: 0
    notYetLabel: 
    expression: 0
    faceElement: 0
    showLearnMore: 0
    showElements: 0
  - id: battle-intro
    kind: 0
    scene: 1
    targetName: nameplate
    holeTargetName: 
    dock: 0
    lines:
    - Here's today's monster and its HP bar.
    - Finish about 70% of today's habits to knock it out.
    footnote: 
    transitions: []
    resumeStepId: 
    lockSkipUntilFirstHabit: 0
    notYetLabel: 
    expression: 0
    faceElement: 0
    showLearnMore: 0
    showElements: 0
  - id: weakness
    kind: 0
    scene: 1
    targetName: weakness-chip
    holeTargetName: 
    dock: 0
    lines:
    - This chip shows its weakness. Habits from that pillar deal double damage!
    footnote: 
    transitions: []
    resumeStepId: 
    lockSkipUntilFirstHabit: 0
    notYetLabel: 
    expression: 0
    faceElement: 0
    showLearnMore: 0
    showElements: 0
  - id: attack-sheet
    kind: 0
    scene: 1
    targetName: attack-sheet
    holeTargetName: 
    dock: 0
    lines:
    - Each button is one of your habits.
    - Only tap one after you've really done it. That's the hero's honour code!
    footnote: 
    transitions: []
    resumeStepId: 
    lockSkipUntilFirstHabit: 0
    notYetLabel: 
    expression: 0
    faceElement: 0
    showLearnMore: 0
    showElements: 0
  - id: first-attack
    kind: 1
    scene: 1
    targetName: attack-sheet
    holeTargetName: 
    dock: 0
    lines:
    - Done one of these today already? Tap it to attack!
    - If not, tap Not yet.
    footnote: 
    transitions:
    - on: 8
      state: 0
      toStepId: hit
      replayOnly: 0
    - on: 2
      state: 0
      toStepId: come-back
      replayOnly: 0
    resumeStepId: 
    lockSkipUntilFirstHabit: 0
    notYetLabel: Not yet
    expression: 0
    faceElement: 0
    showLearnMore: 0
    showElements: 0
  - id: hit
    kind: 0
    scene: 1
    targetName: hp-bar-track
    holeTargetName: 
    dock: 0
    lines:
    - Direct hit! Keep logging habits through the day to wear it down.
    footnote: 
    transitions:
    - on: 0
      state: 0
      toStepId: wrap-up
      replayOnly: 0
    resumeStepId: 
    lockSkipUntilFirstHabit: 0
    notYetLabel: 
    expression: 0
    faceElement: 2
    showLearnMore: 0
    showElements: 0
  - id: come-back
    kind: 0
    scene: 1
    targetName: 
    holeTargetName: 
    dock: 0
    lines:
    - No rush. Come back after your first habit.
    - The monster will wait for you.
    footnote: 
    transitions: []
    resumeStepId: 
    lockSkipUntilFirstHabit: 0
    notYetLabel: 
    expression: 0
    faceElement: 0
    showLearnMore: 0
    showElements: 0
  - id: wrap-up
    kind: 0
    scene: 1
    targetName: 
    holeTargetName: 
    dock: 0
    lines:
    - If the monster is still standing at midnight, it hits back gently. There's no game over.
    - Beat it to level up a pillar. Good luck, hero!
    footnote: 
    transitions:
    - on: 0
      state: 0
      toStepId: 
      replayOnly: 0
    resumeStepId: 
    lockSkipUntilFirstHabit: 0
    notYetLabel: 
    expression: 1
    faceElement: 0
    showLearnMore: 0
    showElements: 0
  - id: rest-day
    kind: 0
    scene: 0
    targetName: today-plaque
    holeTargetName: 
    dock: 0
    lines:
    - Today's monster is already beaten! Your next one arrives tomorrow.
    - Come back then and put your habits to work.
    footnote: 
    transitions:
    - on: 0
      state: 0
      toStepId: 
      replayOnly: 0
    resumeStepId: 
    lockSkipUntilFirstHabit: 0
    notYetLabel: 
    expression: 0
    faceElement: 4
    showLearnMore: 0
    showElements: 0
  playMissingHabitsLine: Every pillar needs a habit first. Tap Habits and add one for {0}.
  playClaimRewardLine: Your reward is waiting! Tap Claim Reward.
  replayPrompt: Shall I show you around again?
  tips:
  - id: tip-levelup
    trigger: 4
    scene: 1
    afterFirstBattle: 0
    callout:
      id: tip-levelup
      kind: 0
      scene: 1
      targetName: level-up-featured
      holeTargetName: 
      dock: 2
      lines:
      - Victory! Pick a pillar to level up.
      - The recommended one is today's weakness. Stronger pillars hit harder.
      footnote: 
      transitions: []
      resumeStepId: 
      lockSkipUntilFirstHabit: 0
      notYetLabel: 
      expression: 0
      faceElement: 4
      showLearnMore: 0
      showElements: 0
  - id: tip-reminder
    trigger: 5
    scene: 1
    afterFirstBattle: 0
    callout:
      id: tip-reminder
      kind: 0
      scene: 1
      targetName: adjust-habits-button
      holeTargetName: 
      dock: 2
      lines:
      - Missing a day is okay. Every hero rests.
      - If your plan felt too heavy, tap Adjust Habits to lighten it.
      footnote: 
      transitions: []
      resumeStepId: 
      lockSkipUntilFirstHabit: 0
      notYetLabel: 
      expression: 0
      faceElement: 0
      showLearnMore: 0
      showElements: 0
  - id: tip-progress
    trigger: 1
    scene: 0
    afterFirstBattle: 1
    callout:
      id: tip-progress
      kind: 0
      scene: 0
      targetName: dashboard-button
      holeTargetName: 
      dock: 1
      lines:
      - Tap Progress to see your Adventure Log.
      - It shows your streaks and which pillars need some love.
      footnote: 
      transitions: []
      resumeStepId: 
      lockSkipUntilFirstHabit: 0
      notYetLabel: 
      expression: 0
      faceElement: 0
      showLearnMore: 0
      showElements: 0
  tipGotItLabel: Got it
